# .env.example — optional LOCAL overrides for the dsv4-flash kit (copy to .env, untracked).
#
# The real serving values live in dsv4-flash.env.canonical (tracked). Put a key
# here only to change it on this machine for a test, e.g.:
#
#   DSV4F_MAX_MODEL_LEN=65536
#   DSV4F_GPU_MEM_UTIL=0.72
#   DSV4F_NCCL_DEBUG=INFO          # proves NET/IB (not TCP) in the head log
#   DSV4F_FLASHINFER_AUTOTUNE=0
#
# Never put DSV4F_HEAD_GID / DSV4F_WORKER_GID here: the orchestrator resolves
# them live per rank, and a pin goes stale after a reboot (D-051).
# A key already in the caller's environment beats this file.
